  <h3>The Story of Gymshark: From Garage Screen Printing to Global Fitness Icon</h3>
  <p>Founded in 2012 in Solihull, Birmingham, United Kingdom by 19-year-old Ben Francis and Lewis Morgan, <strong>Gymshark</strong> revolutionized athletic wear by merging bodybuilding gym culture with contemporary tailored streetwear aesthetics. Starting from a modest garage with a manual screen-printing press and sewing machine, Gymshark pioneered the modern fitness creator movement. Today, Gymshark is recognized globally for its squat-proof circular seamless knitwear, muscle-hugging cuts, and high-performance training fabrics engineered specifically for lifters, runners, and everyday conditioning athletes.</p>

